#include "Header.leaf"

// #region Fallbacks

// The game jumps here automatically (instead of showing choices) when the player
// has run out of time. Define a node with this name in each chapter file to customize.
:: Fallback.OutOfTime
@exposed

{@}
        You're out of time.
        $call BeginIntervention()

// The game jumps here automatically when the player still has time, but every
// remaining choice has already been exhausted.
:: Fallback.OutOfOptions
@exposed

{@}
        There's nothing more you can do here.

// #endregion
